    "preamble": "M/S Bajrang Sweets And Namkeen vs State Of Up And 3 Others on 15 April, 2024 Author: Vivek Kumar Birla Bench: Vivek Kumar Birla High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc:64946-Db Court No. - 29 Case :- Writ - C No. - 5418 of 2024 Petitioner :- M/S Bajrang Sweets And Namkeen Respondent :- State Of Up And 3 Others",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "At the very outset, Sri Dileep Kumar Kesarwani, learned Additional Chief Standing Counsel appearing for the respondents has raised a preliminary objection that the petitioner has an alternative remedy before the tribunal constituted under Section 70 (1) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. He has produced a copy of the notification dated 13.5.2014."
